      exam: [
        { zh: "务必能区分三种错误：题目常给出一个现象让你判断属于语法、运行时还是逻辑错误。例如「结果多算了 1」是逻辑错误，「除以零导致中止」是运行时错误。", en: "Be able to classify the three kinds of errors: questions often describe a symptom and ask which type it is. A result that is off by one is a logic error; a divide-by-zero abort is a run-time error.", ms: "Pastikan anda boleh mengelaskan tiga jenis ralat: soalan sering menerangkan gejala dan meminta anda menentukannya. Hasil yang tersasar satu ialah ralat logik; pembahagian dengan sifar ialah ralat masa jalan." },
        { zh: "对象模型的类比题很常见：Class = 汽车图纸，Object = 某一辆车，Properties = 颜色/型号，Methods = 启动/停止，Events = 到达/碰撞。", en: "Analogy questions on the object model are common: Class = the automobile blueprint, Object = an individual car, Properties = colour/model, Methods = start/stop, Events = arrive/crash.", ms: "Soalan analogi model objek kerap keluar: Class = pelan kereta, Object = sebuah kereta tertentu, Properties = warna/model, Methods = start/stop, Events = arrive/crash." },
        { zh: "记住 IDE 各窗口的用途：工具箱放控件、属性窗口改属性、解决方案资源管理器管文件、窗体设计器画界面。", en: "Remember what each IDE window is for: Toolbox holds controls, Properties window changes properties, Solution Explorer manages files, Form Designer lays out the interface.", ms: "Ingat fungsi setiap tetingkap IDE: Kotak Alat menyimpan kawalan, tetingkap Sifat mengubah sifat, Penjelajah Penyelesaian mengurus fail, Pereka Borang menyusun antara muka." }
      ],
